{28}{Thorvald? Who's he?}{}{5}{}{32}{ }
{32}{Thorvald is the leader of this enclave. He settles all disputes within its walls. But to get to see him you'll need to talk to Ogdin, his guard, first.}{Thorvald is the leader of this enclave. He settles all disputes within its walls. But to get to see him you'll need to talk to Ogdin, his guard, first.}{}{}{}{gf1058 1 }
