{42}{Females are always welcome here. You can go in, but first you need to hear the rules. There are only two of them - you can do anything you want as long as it doesn't interfere with anyone else, and in the event of any dispute, Thorvald is the final word.}{Females are always welcome here. You can go in, but first you need to hear the rules. There are only two of them - you can do anything you want as long as it doesn't interfere with anyone else, and in the event of any dispute, Thorvald is the final word.}{}{}{}{in-4410, gf2133 1 }
{43}{A:}{}{5}{}{52}{ }
{52}{One more thing. I must warn you about wandering outside of the encampment, here.}{One more thing. I must warn you about wandering outside of the encampment, here.}{}{}{}{ }
{53}{Why is that?}{}{5}{}{62}{ }
{54}{Why dat?}{}{-4}{}{62}{ }
{62}{We've lost quite a few people to a sorcerous beast that defies our guns. I myself saw a man eaten alive by the beast when his gun misfired.}{We've lost quite a few people to a sorcerous beast that defies our guns. I myself saw a man eaten alive by the beast when his gun misfired.}{}{}{}{qu1071 1 }
{63}{Thanks for the warning.}{}{5}{gf2134 0}{0}{ }
