{73}{A:}{}{5}{}{52}{ }
{82}{We think it lives north of here. That is all we know, you will have to track it yourself to find its lair. We have a powerful magical amulet we'll give you for killing it, but I can't tell you what power it holds. It has never been identified.}{We think it lives north of here. That is all we know, you will have to track it yourself to find its lair. We have a powerful magical amulet we'll give you for killing it, but I can't tell you what power it holds. It has never been identified.}{}{}{}{ }
{83}{It is a deal, sir.}{}{5}{gf2133 1}{0}{qu1071 2 }
{84}{I'll have to think on this further.}{}{5}{gf2133 1}{0}{lf1 1 }
{92}{I suppose we could let you in, but watch your step. If you step out of the straight and narrow, I'll be forced to knock you about. Got me?}{I suppose we could let you in, but watch your step. If you step out of the straight and narrow, I'll be forced to knock you about. Got me?}{}{}{}{ }
